## Command

```shell
biome lint --error-on-warnings file.vue
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": { "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "recommended": false,
      "correctness": { "noUndeclaredVariables": "error" }
    }
  }
}
```

